{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Apee Escapee</strong> is a retro-styled 2D platformer where teamwork, exploration, and a bit of monkey business are key! Play solo or with a friend as jungle explorers on a mission to <strong>find 8 hidden keys</strong> scattered randomly across each stage. Unlock the massive cage holding the legendary <strong>Great Apee</strong>, and free your furry friend before time runs out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udddd\ufe0f <strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1\u20132 Player Local Co-op:</strong> Play alone or team up with a buddy using gamepads.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Placed Keys:</strong> Each playthrough is different \u2014 explore every corner of the jungle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Pixel Art Aesthetic:</strong> CRT-style visuals and chunky animations straight from the 16-bit era.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Bananas &amp; Gems:</strong> Collect them all for bonus points and secret unlocks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free the Great Apee:</strong> Gather all 8 keys and break every padlock to win!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swing, climb, and jump your way through dense vines, crumbling ruins, and ancient traps \u2014 but remember, Apee is counting on you!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4139400?t=1762332262","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4139400?t=1762332262","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139400/a55833b762eb9ff441cc34198ac1d1139772463a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762332262","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139400/a55833b762eb9ff441cc34198ac1d1139772463a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762332262","categories":[{"description":"Single-pl